WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.025
Here are the ten rules the
check applies on every run.

2
00:00:03.025 --> 00:00:07.621
Most come straight from Learn's standard:
enough accounts, the right domain,

3
00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:11.624
cloud-only, Global Administrator
held permanently and directly,

4
00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:15.330
the right sign-in methods,
membership in the exclusion group,

5
00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.925
and a passing drill in
the last ninety days.

6
00:00:17.925 --> 00:00:21.600
Two are the program's own design,
and they're labeled that way:

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.625
a disabled emergency account is a finding,
and so is anyone in the exclusion group

8
00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:31.650
who isn't an emergency account, because
everyone in that group skips every policy.

9
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.790
The full wording is on the slide.
